    <string name="sc_s23_title">23 · Settings — list page</string>
    <string name="sc_s23_desc">Each sub-item fills a whole, fully tappable row with an arrow on the right. Primary label with optional description below, separated by a hairline.</string>
    <string name="sc_s24_title">24 · Settings — detail page</string>
    <string name="sc_s24_desc">„General“ group with a theme dropdown (system / light / dark). Further headings with example controls; each group sits in a lightly tinted box, separated by a hairline before the next heading.</string>
